<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>CSS Styling</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-image: url("tiger.jpg");
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            color: darkblue;
            text-align: center;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .box {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px;
            border: 2px solid black;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .highlight {
            background-image: url("tiger.jpg");
            background-size: cover;
            padding: 15px;
            color: black;
        }

        .bold {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .italic {
            font-style: italic;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="box">

        <h1>CSS Styling Demonstration</h1>

        <p>This paragraph demonstrates basic CSS styling.</p>

        <p class="bold">This text is bold.</p>

        <p class="italic">This text is italic.</p>

        <div class="highlight">
            <h3>Background Image Example</h3>
            <p>This element uses a separate background image.</p>
            
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
